(5190259, 754427, 102534, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of colours. I''m not sure if I would cropping out the edges of the board would make this stronger. seems to pull my eyes away from the slicing. would focus on the first tomato slice make it look better, as it is obvious he is slicing, but I can''t really see what he is slicing?</td>', 'Nice choice of colours. I''m not sure if I would cropping out the edges of the board would make this stronger. seems to pull my eyes away from the slicing. would focus on the first tomato slice make it look better, as it is obvious he is slicing, but I can''t really see what he is slicing?', '2009-01-14 05:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
