(5190318, 754982, 60173, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea. Yummy kiwi colors!<br/> <br/>However, I don''t think the harsh lighting is doing this photo much good. Your lights are throwing very dark shadows that are adding more of a distraction than interest. I would suggest diffusing your light sources to get softer edges on your shadows.</td>', 'Very nice idea. Yummy kiwi colors! However, I don''t think the harsh lighting is doing this photo much good. Your lights are throwing very dark shadows that are adding more of a distraction than interest. I would suggest diffusing your light sources to get softer edges on your shadows.', '2009-01-14 06:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190321, 755579, 60173, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Excellent composition and great clear depth.<br/> <br/>I''m not voting, but just to be picky about the "Stock Photo" theme... stock sites would probably reject this photo because of the product name. Some voters might knock you for that.</td>', 'Great photo. Excellent composition and great clear depth. I''m not voting, but just to be picky about the "Stock Photo" theme... stock sites would probably reject this photo because of the product name. Some voters might knock you for that.', '2009-01-14 06:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190324, 755995, 60173, '<td valign="top">Your tomatoes have smilies!</td>', 'Your tomatoes have smilies!', '2009-01-14 06:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190326, 755700, 63633, '<td valign="top">This would have been so much better with a lot of noise reduction on the steam (probably in reality smoke). Smoke highlights noise really badly, but responds well to noise reduction software like neatimage.</td>', 'This would have been so much better with a lot of noise reduction on the steam (probably in reality smoke). Smoke highlights noise really badly, but responds well to noise reduction software like neatimage.', '2009-01-14 06:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190328, 754735, 60173, '<td valign="top">That''s the most gorgeous garlic clove I''ve ever seen. Very dreamy lighting and processing. Something about this looks like a colored pencil drawing or something. I''m not sure what to say about the shade of red, but I love it. <br/> <br/>What kind of garlic is it?</td>', 'That''s the most gorgeous garlic clove I''ve ever seen. Very dreamy lighting and processing. Something about this looks like a colored pencil drawing or something. I''m not sure what to say about the shade of red, but I love it.  What kind of garlic is it?', '2009-01-14 06:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190331, 755993, 60173, '<td valign="top">The first thing that grabbed me was the blue fingernail polish. One of the points of Stock Photography is to have the maximum possible buying scope. You might lose the more conservative crowd with the nail color choice.<br/> <br/>Don''t get me wrong, I think the idea is a good one and your execution is well done. I think you may have been a little slow on the shutter speed (the salt seems a little too streaky and looks more like powdered sugar), but the composition and lighting are very nice.</td>', 'The first thing that grabbed me was the blue fingernail polish. One of the points of Stock Photography is to have the maximum possible buying scope. You might lose the more conservative crowd with the nail color choice. Don''t get me wrong, I think the idea is a good one and your execution is well done. I think you may have been a little slow on the shutter speed (the salt seems a little too streaky and looks more like powdered sugar), but the composition and lighting are very nice.', '2009-01-14 06:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190332, 753920, 60173, '<td valign="top">It''s quite hard to tell what I''m looking at. I can make out the burner, but can only assume I''m seeing a pot on top. There''s a couple objects that appear to be knobs, so I''m really confused.</td>', 'It''s quite hard to tell what I''m looking at. I can make out the burner, but can only assume I''m seeing a pot on top. There''s a couple objects that appear to be knobs, so I''m really confused.', '2009-01-14 06:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190334, 754502, 60173, '<td valign="top">I''m fascinated by that steam! It looks like it should be fake, but can''t pinpoint anything that would back that up. <br/> <br/>I think this image would have been very striking without the blown out right side and the reflections in the mug. The tonal balance on the left side is quite nice, and the composition is pleasing. I even like the faint *ting* star you got on the rim of the mug.</td>', 'I''m fascinated by that steam! It looks like it should be fake, but can''t pinpoint anything that would back that up.  I think this image would have been very striking without the blown out right side and the reflections in the mug. The tonal balance on the left side is quite nice, and the composition is pleasing. I even like the faint *ting* star you got on the rim of the mug.', '2009-01-14 06:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5190396, 754161, 98171, '<td valign="top">ha, awesome photo</td>', 'ha, awesome photo', '2009-01-14 07:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
