(5192494, 755936, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hmmmmm...  Colorful, I like the streamers, but the bottom plate is distracting and should have been cloned out or concealed somehow.  The color on the frosting is also a bit harsh.</td>', 'Hmmmmm...  Colorful, I like the streamers, but the bottom plate is distracting and should have been cloned out or concealed somehow.  The color on the frosting is also a bit harsh.', '2009-01-15 09:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
