(5193442, 754735, 99063, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what it is exactly, but I really like this a lot.... It looks kind of...soft or blurry, but the good kind.  And I really like the shadows and the background especially.  Hmm--I wish I could do that!  :)</td>', 'I don''t know what it is exactly, but I really like this a lot.... It looks kind of...soft or blurry, but the good kind.  And I really like the shadows and the background especially.  Hmm--I wish I could do that!  :)', '2009-01-15 19:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5193551, 755941, 96751, '<td valign="top">The soft focus detracts from an otherwise good shot.</td>', 'The soft focus detracts from an otherwise good shot.', '2009-01-15 20:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5193556, 754577, 96751, '<td valign="top">Yummmmm.  The only thing that could possibly make this better is a bit of drippy chocolate.  And a little less light center left.</td>', 'Yummmmm.  The only thing that could possibly make this better is a bit of drippy chocolate.  And a little less light center left.', '2009-01-15 20:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5193560, 754327, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is so lovely.  I''m impressed you can make a raw egg yolk look this appetizing.</td>', 'This is so lovely.  I''m impressed you can make a raw egg yolk look this appetizing.', '2009-01-15 20:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5193562, 755994, 96751, '<td valign="top">Me likely.  Nice colors, the flames are well-defined.  The crop might not be stock though.  Regardless, nice flame shot.</td>', 'Me likely.  Nice colors, the flames are well-defined.  The crop might not be stock though.  Regardless, nice flame shot.', '2009-01-15 20:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5193569, 755861, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great colors, strong lines on the plate.  The surface reflection may be a bit over-contrasty and the cheese could be sharper.  Also, the crop would probably be a stronger "stock" shot as a square, with less empty space on the bottom.</td>', 'Great colors, strong lines on the plate.  The surface reflection may be a bit over-contrasty and the cheese could be sharper.  Also, the crop would probably be a stronger "stock" shot as a square, with less empty space on the bottom.', '2009-01-15 20:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5193574, 755737, 96751, '<td valign="top">GREAT sauce shot.  I want to lick the spoon.  But I also want it to be sharper</td>', 'GREAT sauce shot.  I want to lick the spoon.  But I also want it to be sharper', '2009-01-15 20:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5193657, 755499, 76598, '<td valign="top">I am color blind, but the color strikes me as being too yellow</td>', 'I am color blind, but the color strikes me as being too yellow', '2009-01-15 21:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5193658, 756003, 76598, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but it needs more depth of field</td>', 'Nice image, but it needs more depth of field', '2009-01-15 21:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5193661, 755874, 76598, '<td valign="top">Very nice, the hot spot on the end of the cut pepper is a bit distracting</td>', 'Very nice, the hot spot on the end of the cut pepper is a bit distracting', '2009-01-15 21:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5193753, 755876, 100727, '<td valign="top">A nice capture.  This truly shows the ART of cooking, and NOT the art of DISPLAY.  This photo is relevant to the challenge.</td>', 'A nice capture.  This truly shows the ART of cooking, and NOT the art of DISPLAY.  This photo is relevant to the challenge.', '2009-01-15 22:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5193767, 755846, 100727, '<td valign="top">Nice expression.  It gives me the sense of balancing the cooking.  To me, this is an art -- in cooking, it''s about balancing the ingredients to reach that tasty level.  I wish that the guy''s shirt has some contrast as it looks pretty flat.  The shadow is fine with me.  About the fruits ... are they really like that ... I mean in that perfect order?</td>', 'Nice expression.  It gives me the sense of balancing the cooking.  To me, this is an art -- in cooking, it''s about balancing the ingredients to reach that tasty level.  I wish that the guy''s shirt has some contrast as it looks pretty flat.  The shadow is fine with me.  About the fruits ... are they really like that ... I mean in that perfect order?', '2009-01-15 22:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5193824, 755784, 97225, '<td valign="top">I like the pov on this.</td>', 'I like the pov on this.', '2009-01-15 23:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5193825, 755035, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely arrangement and the ingredients all look perfect.</td>', 'Lovely arrangement and the ingredients all look perfect.', '2009-01-15 23:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5193827, 755973, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nice clear and simple shot. It looks like a really good stock shot.</td>', 'Nice clear and simple shot. It looks like a really good stock shot.', '2009-01-15 23:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5193829, 755947, 97225, '<td valign="top">I think the inclusion of the trash bin detracts.</td>', 'I think the inclusion of the trash bin detracts.', '2009-01-15 23:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5193830, 754320, 97225, '<td valign="top">Good pov and dof. Maybe a tad busy.</td>', 'Good pov and dof. Maybe a tad busy.', '2009-01-15 23:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5193832, 755878, 97225, '<td valign="top">That is very clever. It is a nicely composed and exposed photo too.</td>', 'That is very clever. It is a nicely composed and exposed photo too.', '2009-01-15 23:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5193842, 755390, 97225, '<td valign="top">I really like this and can see it in a cooking article or book. 10</td>', 'I really like this and can see it in a cooking article or book. 10', '2009-01-15 23:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5193843, 755700, 97225, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot and could definitely be used as a stock shot. 10</td>', 'This is a great shot and could definitely be used as a stock shot. 10', '2009-01-15 23:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5193845, 755936, 97225, '<td valign="top">These cup cakes look fabulous, and I can see the picture in a party recipe book. 10</td>', 'These cup cakes look fabulous, and I can see the picture in a party recipe book. 10', '2009-01-15 23:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5193846, 755509, 97225, '<td valign="top">This shot is beautiful and unique. I can see it being used in a variety of productions. 10</td>', 'This shot is beautiful and unique. I can see it being used in a variety of productions. 10', '2009-01-15 23:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5193848, 755946, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.</td>', 'Lovely shot.', '2009-01-15 23:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
