(5194567, 755499, 20748, '<td valign="top">I think I baked about 200 of these cookies last month with my girlfriend.</td>', 'I think I baked about 200 of these cookies last month with my girlfriend.', '2009-01-16 07:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
