(5201299, 755695, 47852, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition with the 9 boxes.  I like the rustic feel, and while the middle box with the packaged ingredients doesn''t quite go with that rustic feel, that package of dixie spoons in the bottom stands out like a sore thumb to me.</td>', 'Interesting composition with the 9 boxes.  I like the rustic feel, and while the middle box with the packaged ingredients doesn''t quite go with that rustic feel, that package of dixie spoons in the bottom stands out like a sore thumb to me.', '2009-01-18 10:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201323, 755854, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like shallow dof shots that take on a sort of abstract feel more than most, I think.  I do wish there was a bit more lighting on the front so that there wasn''t such a dark space.  Overall, a nice shot, though the dof might be a bit too shallow for a stock photo?</td>', 'I like shallow dof shots that take on a sort of abstract feel more than most, I think.  I do wish there was a bit more lighting on the front so that there wasn''t such a dark space.  Overall, a nice shot, though the dof might be a bit too shallow for a stock photo?', '2009-01-18 10:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201328, 754302, 98339, '<td valign="top">great color, good idea...great focus...top pick....hope the pan is alright...oh lover of cooking that I am...</td>', 'great color, good idea...great focus...top pick....hope the pan is alright...oh lover of cooking that I am...', '2009-01-18 10:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201331, 755499, 98339, '<td valign="top">mmmm great shot...would really work for a cookie cookbook or magazine...</td>', 'mmmm great shot...would really work for a cookie cookbook or magazine...', '2009-01-18 10:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201333, 755621, 98339, '<td valign="top">One of the few that actually showed "cooking"...great set up</td>', 'One of the few that actually showed "cooking"...great set up', '2009-01-18 10:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201336, 755700, 98339, '<td valign="top">good idea...nice shot</td>', 'good idea...nice shot', '2009-01-18 10:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201340, 754320, 98339, '<td valign="top">very good...someone actually cooking...</td>', 'very good...someone actually cooking...', '2009-01-18 10:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201341, 754302, 47852, '<td valign="top">Nice clean shot, though I''m not sure that some of the stock sites would be happy with the product name being so prominent.  Hope you didn''t have to take too many shots... looks like this could have been a toasty shoot with all those flames!</td>', 'Nice clean shot, though I''m not sure that some of the stock sites would be happy with the product name being so prominent.  Hope you didn''t have to take too many shots... looks like this could have been a toasty shoot with all those flames!', '2009-01-18 10:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201357, 754516, 98339, '<td valign="top">not sure what is on the table in front of the sushi...</td>', 'not sure what is on the table in front of the sushi...', '2009-01-18 10:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201359, 754929, 98339, '<td valign="top">good shot of Creme Brulee</td>', 'good shot of Creme Brulee', '2009-01-18 10:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
