(5204694, 754835, 46314, '<td valign="top">The lighting is very uneven - the chicken gets lost in shadow, whilst the lower part of the plate is shiny and reflective. Ultimately, the whole thing looks a little bland, which doesn''t make the food look appetising. Plus, one thing common in food stock shots is huge attention to detail in the arrangement of the food, whereas here - your chicken has smeared the plate - that could easily have been cleaned.</td>', 'The lighting is very uneven - the chicken gets lost in shadow, whilst the lower part of the plate is shiny and reflective. Ultimately, the whole thing looks a little bland, which doesn''t make the food look appetising. Plus, one thing common in food stock shots is huge attention to detail in the arrangement of the food, whereas here - your chicken has smeared the plate - that could easily have been cleaned.', '2009-01-19 16:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
