(5205845, 755695, 86316, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite put my finger on it, but there''s something about this photo I absolutely love. Could be the b&amp;w, could be the unusualness, or maybe the fact that it''s called Cooking with Jesus. One of my favourites so far, it''s not your typical stock photo.. but I think that''s part of the reason I love it. 9</td>', 'I can''t quite put my finger on it, but there''s something about this photo I absolutely love. Could be the b&w, could be the unusualness, or maybe the fact that it''s called Cooking with Jesus. One of my favourites so far, it''s not your typical stock photo.. but I think that''s part of the reason I love it. 9', '2009-01-20 01:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205847, 755474, 86316, '<td valign="top">Nice use of colour, love the napkin also it works very well. And who doesn''t love milk and cookies? :P 8</td>', 'Nice use of colour, love the napkin also it works very well. And who doesn''t love milk and cookies? :P 8', '2009-01-20 01:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
