(5207501, 755474, 8054, '<td valign="top">I love this photo but would love it even more without the triangle on the bottom. I feel it seems to detract more than it adds (even though it is pointing up towards the plate). Also the arrangement of the Oreos seems a little too "sterile" for my tastes. I guess it would depend on the end-use of the photo.</td>', 'I love this photo but would love it even more without the triangle on the bottom. I feel it seems to detract more than it adds (even though it is pointing up towards the plate). Also the arrangement of the Oreos seems a little too "sterile" for my tastes. I guess it would depend on the end-use of the photo.', '2009-01-20 19:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5207509, 754502, 8054, '<td valign="top">That is pretty cool looking! Nice capture of the individual steam droplets and it looks great in b/w. Just one negative aspect is the "thing" at the top of the steam. Looks like it might have been a drop of water on the lens or some weird-shaped lens flare.</td>', 'That is pretty cool looking! Nice capture of the individual steam droplets and it looks great in b/w. Just one negative aspect is the "thing" at the top of the steam. Looks like it might have been a drop of water on the lens or some weird-shaped lens flare.', '2009-01-20 19:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
