(5207962, 755881, 29011, '<td valign="top">Big congrats! on this very well deserved win :)<br/>Though I didn''t vote, this was my favorite from the challenge. I also liked it a whole lot that you show the process of cooking and not just the final cooked product. It''s also a shot that is great for stock ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-21 00:10:25.</i></td>', 'Big congrats! on this very well deserved win :)Though I didn''t vote, this was my favorite from the challenge. I also liked it a whole lot that you show the process of cooking and not just the final cooked product. It''s also a shot that is great for stock ;)', '2009-01-21 00:09:09.000000', '2009-01-21 00:10:25.000000', 0),
(5207976, 755540, 29011, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the PB and a very first challenge ribbon :)<br/>This shot is very well put together. I like the warm inviting orange background. Maybe the pouring of the milk seems somewhat out of place, but that''s my only nitpick.</td>', 'Congratulations on the PB and a very first challenge ribbon :)This shot is very well put together. I like the warm inviting orange background. Maybe the pouring of the milk seems somewhat out of place, but that''s my only nitpick.', '2009-01-21 00:13:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5207978, 755540, 49643, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! Love the exposure &amp; colors.</td>', 'Congratulations! Love the exposure & colors.', '2009-01-21 00:13:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5207991, 754735, 28359, '<td valign="top">Simplicity at it''s best! Great colors &amp; detail. The composition works very well. I could see this hanging in some Italian restaurant. Congrats on your top 10 finish.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-21 00:18:26.</i></td>', 'Simplicity at it''s best! Great colors & detail. The composition works very well. I could see this hanging in some Italian restaurant. Congrats on your top 10 finish.', '2009-01-21 00:16:57.000000', '2009-01-21 00:18:26.000000', 0),
(5208012, 755509, 29011, '<td valign="top">A most creative take. The setup is very cool. Clay is certainly something every photog must have ;) I only have mixed thoughts on the cool colors reflecting off of the greens. <br/> <br/>Perhaps the shot needed some extra light fill for the left side of the frame? Because the left most herb stalk(Basil?) isn''t as illuminated as the others. Still, it''s a great shot overall.</td>', 'A most creative take. The setup is very cool. Clay is certainly something every photog must have ;) I only have mixed thoughts on the cool colors reflecting off of the greens.  Perhaps the shot needed some extra light fill for the left side of the frame? Because the left most herb stalk(Basil?) isn''t as illuminated as the others. Still, it''s a great shot overall.', '2009-01-21 00:21:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5208017, 754735, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love the look of this.  It reminds me of herb photos that people frame and hang in their kitchens.</td>', 'I love the look of this.  It reminds me of herb photos that people frame and hang in their kitchens.', '2009-01-21 00:22:18.000000', NULL, 0),
