(5208043, 754244, 91282, '<td valign="top">43rd place?? I did not expect that. :( You were robbed my friend. This is still one of my favorites in the challenge, and you did a fantastic job. I look forward to more of your work.<br/> <br/>In retrospect, I guess maybe it scored lower because this is a "Stock Cooking" challenge, and I suppose this isn''t a typical stock cookbook type picture.... So maybe it would have scored higher in a different challenge.</td>', '43rd place?? I did not expect that. :( You were robbed my friend. This is still one of my favorites in the challenge, and you did a fantastic job. I look forward to more of your work. In retrospect, I guess maybe it scored lower because this is a "Stock Cooking" challenge, and I suppose this isn''t a typical stock cookbook type picture.... So maybe it would have scored higher in a different challenge.', '2009-01-21 00:28:24.000000', NULL, 0),
