(5208891, 755552, 67697, '<td valign="top">Those look yummy, did you make them from scratch?  I''m a nestle instant-cookie dough girl myself (chop and drop!)  I think for the challenge, I would have fixed the tilt and get rid of some of the blurred ones in the foreground.  From my rejection experiences in stock (lol) they seem to want more focus in the foreground.  Hope you enjoyed the cookies!</td>', 'Those look yummy, did you make them from scratch?  I''m a nestle instant-cookie dough girl myself (chop and drop!)  I think for the challenge, I would have fixed the tilt and get rid of some of the blurred ones in the foreground.  From my rejection experiences in stock (lol) they seem to want more focus in the foreground.  Hope you enjoyed the cookies!', '2009-01-21 09:22:06.000000', NULL, 0),
