(5211593, 754515, 52115, '<td valign="top">Looks good and delicious, too. I bet they even taste better then mountain oysters. Congratulations on 4th-Place! I like the concept, it goes with many food themes, so it''s great for stock.<br/> <br/>Now if there was a pan of water under it with some water drops...</td>', 'Looks good and delicious, too. I bet they even taste better then mountain oysters. Congratulations on 4th-Place! I like the concept, it goes with many food themes, so it''s great for stock. Now if there was a pan of water under it with some water drops...', '2009-01-22 11:10:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5211647, 755618, 66384, '<td valign="top">Fun play on the word ''stock''. I like the red and gold colors and the composition. I''d like to see some color and texture added to the background, because this looks too much like a cut and paste job.<br/>(edited for typos.)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-22 11:47:03.</i></td>', 'Fun play on the word ''stock''. I like the red and gold colors and the composition. I''d like to see some color and texture added to the background, because this looks too much like a cut and paste job.(edited for typos.)', '2009-01-22 11:44:16.000000', '2009-01-22 11:47:03.000000', 0),
(5211668, 755973, 66384, '<td valign="top">Really nice stock photo. I think the lighting is excellent, and there is just enough color and texture in the background to give it depth. The reflection at the bottom makes this particularly good, and I really like the clarity and shine of the subject.</td>', 'Really nice stock photo. I think the lighting is excellent, and there is just enough color and texture in the background to give it depth. The reflection at the bottom makes this particularly good, and I really like the clarity and shine of the subject.', '2009-01-22 11:53:01.000000', NULL, 0),
