(5212248, 755947, 77196, '<td valign="top">Sorry. I got a good laugh out of this (the idea of doing the dicing on the floor!). <br/>Welcome to dpchallenge. I hope you''ll submit many more pictures. This is a great place to learn (if you can tolerate the comments). One suggestion I got that was very helpful was to participate in the side challenges (see Community Forums). This helps you to get to know others, and get helpful comments on your pictures - since they know who you are, they''ll try to be more helpful than judgmental). <br/></td>', 'Sorry. I got a good laugh out of this (the idea of doing the dicing on the floor!). Welcome to dpchallenge. I hope you''ll submit many more pictures. This is a great place to learn (if you can tolerate the comments). One suggestion I got that was very helpful was to participate in the side challenges (see Community Forums). This helps you to get to know others, and get helpful comments on your pictures - since they know who you are, they''ll try to be more helpful than judgmental). ', '2009-01-22 17:06:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5212564, 755540, 79955, '<td valign="top">Congrats Agnes!!! just saw this. Beautifully lit, colors go together very well.IMO having the glass there is great, helps in the composition and gives te entire shot more breathing space and allows te viewer look for more details. <br/>my only comment for improvement was maybe using an egg basket without the handle, this would then allow you to have a different crop and go without the glass.<br/></td>', 'Congrats Agnes!!! just saw this. Beautifully lit, colors go together very well.IMO having the glass there is great, helps in the composition and gives te entire shot more breathing space and allows te viewer look for more details. my only comment for improvement was maybe using an egg basket without the handle, this would then allow you to have a different crop and go without the glass.', '2009-01-22 19:43:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5212630, 755878, 79955, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Red!!! wonderfully executed and well lit too.</td>', 'Congrats on the Red!!! wonderfully executed and well lit too.', '2009-01-22 19:55:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5212801, 755509, 86322, '<td valign="top">Thank you guys a lot for your kind comments they have made all the effort on making this shot worthy.</td>', 'Thank you guys a lot for your kind comments they have made all the effort on making this shot worthy.', '2009-01-22 20:52:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5213090, 755700, 98022, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the great comments and scores! A PB for me and my first HM!<br/> <br/>I think that I should have titled this photo a little more directly, because the effect I was going for was pasta so hot it was smoking, not just steaming. Most people thought that I was trying to show steam (which I probably should have done). My first idea fot a title, "Hot Pasta", has been used many times, so I avoided that one. Looking back I should have gone with something more direct like "Smoking Hot Pasta".<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-22 22:28:14.</i></td>', 'Thanks everyone for the great comments and scores! A PB for me and my first HM! I think that I should have titled this photo a little more directly, because the effect I was going for was pasta so hot it was smoking, not just steaming. Most people thought that I was trying to show steam (which I probably should have done). My first idea fot a title, "Hot Pasta", has been used many times, so I avoided that one. Looking back I should have gone with something more direct like "Smoking Hot Pasta".', '2009-01-22 22:27:46.000000', '2009-01-22 22:28:14.000000', 0),
(5213806, 755878, 66515, '<td valign="top">Really cool idea and well executed.  Congrats on the red. It will probably be your first of many!</td>', 'Really cool idea and well executed.  Congrats on the red. It will probably be your first of many!', '2009-01-23 02:43:09.000000', NULL, 0),
