(5221494, 755881, 28564, '<td valign="top">spectacular photo!<br/> <br/>i like everything here, the "punctum" (Roland Barthes) for me is the little water droplet...<br/> <br/>many compliments!</td>', 'spectacular photo! i like everything here, the "punctum" (Roland Barthes) for me is the little water droplet... many compliments!', '2009-01-27 03:58:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5221501, 755920, 62357, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>From a technical point of view I believe this is a good image.  The composition is good, the angle of the sausages and the depth of field are great.  The focus is good too.  I agree with Eyewave, the border does not really work for this type of shot.<br/> <br/>As I see it, the primary reason this scored so low, relates to the challenge topic.  The challenge was for a stock photo that depicts cooking.  In order for a buyer/editor to pick a photo such as this, there must be something appealing.  Sadly the sausages themselves do not look very interesting or appetising.  The burnt bits do not make me want to eat one.  I think the concept was good and definitely portrayed cooking, as opposed to just food, but overall it was not a very appealing image due to the overdone (and in some parts uncooked) nature of the actual subject.<br/> <br/>Hopefully this helps a little bit.<br/> <br/>Sarah</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club From a technical point of view I believe this is a good image.  The composition is good, the angle of the sausages and the depth of field are great.  The focus is good too.  I agree with Eyewave, the border does not really work for this type of shot. As I see it, the primary reason this scored so low, relates to the challenge topic.  The challenge was for a stock photo that depicts cooking.  In order for a buyer/editor to pick a photo such as this, there must be something appealing.  Sadly the sausages themselves do not look very interesting or appetising.  The burnt bits do not make me want to eat one.  I think the concept was good and definitely portrayed cooking, as opposed to just food, but overall it was not a very appealing image due to the overdone (and in some parts uncooked) nature of the actual subject. Hopefully this helps a little bit. Sarah', '2009-01-27 04:19:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5222188, 755560, 62357, '<td valign="top">This was my highest scoring image in this challenge.  Totally met the challenge, unlike many others.  Should, of course, have scored much, much higher.</td>', 'This was my highest scoring image in this challenge.  Totally met the challenge, unlike many others.  Should, of course, have scored much, much higher.', '2009-01-27 15:35:13.000000', NULL, 0),
